# Caddy reverse proxy for SPAM Purge — gives you automatic HTTPS.
# 1. Replace your-domain.com with your real domain (its DNS A record must point
#    at this VM's IP).
# 2. Install Caddy, put this at /etc/caddy/Caddyfile, then: sudo systemctl reload caddy
#
# HTTPS is required: the app's login cookie is secure-only in production, and
# `trust proxy` is already enabled so Caddy can terminate TLS in front of it.

your-domain.com {
    reverse_proxy localhost:8080
}
